        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our cost matrix combines a base freight charge per cubic foot, a fuel surcharge, insurance premium (IRDAI‑approved marine transit coverage), loading and unloading labor, and any optional services such as temporary storage or bike parcel. All taxes, GST, and e‑Way bill fees are transparently itemised in the final quote.</p>
