        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, the claim is processed swiftly, and you receive full compensation based on the declared value of the item.</p>
